      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/Timeless_Crypto/status/2084487891401724339",
      "text": "If you wondering why there is very little momentum to both the upside and downside all you need to do is take a snapshot of the books across the board \n\nWe keep getting wedged between blocks of large orders where the onus is on aggressive participants to break away from the spread \n\nWe simply don't have that yet as we continue to chop and churn\n\nBig up day y'day in risk and a nice move off the zone from the lows but no follow through any meaningful resistance yet \n\nNotice the block of sellers walking it down within this range shows intent to continue replenshing the ask, as passive seller is happy to play patient on the way down\n\n#BTC",
